"file_name": "CW_EA_Trailer_Thumnail_(2560x1440)_004.png", "id": "861834619644985", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_861834622978318_7152744831054764358_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l4yRzRc2MtsQ7kNvwE2l12r&_nc_oc=AdoD8kd-pj_boZAY_5XBc66Wq2UCg4kW3tGebXMkgBr8K_dN-MbaR9aHjXr1uLMavgQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIo6j2W6M9cZ0XwD7HndBXObyedXSiWXIX7SP6aYhYacQ&oe=6AAE9EB6"}, {"file_name": "CW_EA_Trailer_Thumnail_(2560x1440)_011.png", "id": "864054356046526", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820141_864054359379859_3132543218830287424_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BQp-j3In2HoQ7kNvwH6gk11&_nc_oc=Adp-jeeQNamZB886tUFfQ16qsWBuJXbeqm35zeLLw-ceoerz7lbRPLoXKS328OH7qO0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ4WzwdxS9nyz_miZqCTy8VAoieVEeIO4Q1T_2Y57mrVg&oe=6AAE8AC7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CW_EA_Trailer_Thumnail_(2560x1440)_001.png", "id": "791725770498003", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_791725773831336_7963522473989790612_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NoRHkGlWpMMQ7kNvwHiukT2&_nc_oc=Ado0yiQiRNKO0rSKvc_L379KCbXc2tqGwtnWl6p8MrvjvSP7ifz4DK6hHzYaDwBlFQk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLCx6gBFOEH6JcGCMUwXnBuZR-c3lbLjwp73uU1P2um8Q&oe=6AAEA87B"}, "display_name": "Cozy Worlds", "keywords": ["Sandbox", "Creation", "Cozy", "Garden", "Meditation"], "long_description": "**Imagination is your guide - Cozy Worlds is your canvas**\n\nCozy Worlds is a soothing world-building game where anyone can craft living landscapes - no art experience required! Sculpt floating terrain with a wave of your hand and fill it with vibrant plants, cute critters and enchanting natural elements.\n\n\n**Unlock the Creative Library - with more elements to come!**\n\nDiscover unique plants, ancient ruins and more - bringing color and life to every floating island and rolling hill. \n\n{1127379655819066}\n\n**Intuitive Toolkit to Cultivate Your World**\n\nPaint and erase terrain, interact with living elements, and customize your creations using your intuitive toolkit.\n{2244298876036827}\n\n**Two Ways to Create**\n\nJourney through World-Builder Mode to unlock natural decor and tools - then try Creative Mode to sculpt with zero rules and total creative freedom.\n{1851337849596103}\n\n**About Cozy Worlds Early Access**\n\nIn Early Access, we invite you on a Cozy Worlds journey, to try out our first selection of tools and unlock a range of in-world objects that you can use to build your own cozy worlds. You can expect more journeys, world-building items and animal friends in future updates - for now, we hope this experience sparks joy and leaves you feeling a bit lighter!\n\n\n**Ready to join the Cozy Community?**\n\nConnect with fellow builders on our Discord! discord.gg/fbAvagsC8r \n\n\nCozy Worlds available only for Quest 3 & 3S", "short_description": "Step into Cozy Worlds - a soothing VR world-builder where you craft a dreamy natural sanctuary. Sculpt terrain with a wave of your hand and fill it with vibrant plants, ancient ruins and more.\n\nWhether you need a creative recharge or mindful stress break, Cozy Worlds is here for you to take a breath, explore freely, and follow your inner creativity!\n\nConnect with fellow builders on our Discord! discord.gg/fbAvagsC8r \n\nCozy Worlds available only for Quest 3 & 3S"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vrtogether.us/cozy-worlds-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRTogether", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.vrtogether.us/cozyworlds", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "172599656447212